{
  "intro": [
    {
      "text": "One of the eight basic Allomantic metals. An Allomancer burning it makes a coppercloud that hides their own Allomancy, and that of people nearby, from Seekers.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "final-empire", "chapter": "9" }]
    },
    {
      "text": "A metal used by all three metal-based arts. Allomancers burn it to hide Allomancy, Feruchemists store memories in it, and Hemalurgic spikes of copper steal mental fortitude and memory.",
      "revealedIn": [
        {
          "all": [
            { "book": "final-empire", "chapter": "9" },
            { "book": "well-of-ascension", "chapter": "4" },
            { "book": "hero-of-ages", "chapter": "prologue" },
            { "book": "alloy-of-law", "chapter": "prologue" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "description": [
    {
      "text": "A coppercloud also shields the one burning copper from emotional Allomancy, though shielding others inside it is very hard.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "final-empire", "chapter": "14" }]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sazed keeps records of many old religions in copperminds.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "final-empire", "chapter": "29" }]
    },
    {
      "text": "A memory stored in a coppermind vanishes from the Feruchemist's own mind until it is drawn back out. Memories held only in the mind slowly fade.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "well-of-ascension", "chapter": "15" }]
    },
    {
      "text": "Few can see through a coppercloud: those with a Hemalurgic spike that strengthens their bronze, or Allomancers of unusually strong lineage. A Seeker standing inside a coppercloud senses nothing, even from others inside it.",
      "revealedIn": [
        {
          "all": [
            { "book": "final-empire", "chapter": "9" },
            { "book": "hero-of-ages", "chapter": "73" },
            { "book": "alloy-of-law", "chapter": "prologue" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Keepers fill copperminds with huge stores of knowledge, which does not fade while stored, and make index copperminds to find facts quickly.",
      "revealedIn": [
        {
          "all": [
            { "book": "well-of-ascension", "chapter": "4" },
            { "book": "alloy-of-law", "chapter": "prologue" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "history": [
    {
